<title>USA: LTC says '96 investment totals $205 mln.</title>
<headline>LTC says '96 investment totals $205 mln.</headline>
<dateline>OXNARD, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTC Properties Inc, a real estate investment trust investing in health care-related facilities, on Wednesday said its 1996 investments totaled $205 million, a record for the company.</p>
<p>All of the investments were in the long-term care sector with $154 million, or 75 percent, invested in skilled-nursing facilities and $51 million, or 25 percent, in assisted-living residences.</p>
